    "identifier": "ranton-storm-release-snake-chains",
    "description": "<p>Select one creature you can see within range as you conjure two Storm Snakes adjacent to the target on either side or in a space close to them if adjacent isn’t possible. Each Storm Snake occupies their own space. The Storm Snake has the listed statistics.</p>\n<p>You may command all Storm Snakes as a bonus action on your turn. The Storm Snakes may take an appropriate reaction if able, such as attack of opportunity. The Storm Snakes uses your Ninjutsu Attack bonus for its attacks and your Save DC for all of its effects save DC’s.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3.</p>",
